				"This is considered a multiblock, so go dig out those pedestals I have been talking about and get to work."
				""
				"Place the Arcane Core, probably one block down, then put the Enchanting Apparatus on top of that."
				""
				"Arcane Pedestals go around it in a \"circle\" on the same level as the Apparatus."
