		{
			dependencies: ["1BAEB2F949BB340E"]
			description: [
				"Finally, you can start to look even more like Harry Potter!"
				""
				"Make yourself an Enchanter's Wand, pop it in the Scribe's Table and stick exactly one spell in it."
				""
				"Here are some nitpicky rules that the Potterverse never has to follow:"
				""
				"1) Wand spells have to be Projectile > Accelerate > &ospell&r"
				"2) The Spell you put on the wand cannot have another method of casting (such as Touch)."
				""
				"Put something useful on a wand that you don't want to have in your book."
			]
			id: "15F133B139A811C3"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7E8676134A36BDFF"
				item: "ars_nouveau:wand"
				type: "item"
