		{
			dependencies: ["15F133B139A811C3"]
			description: [
				"The Enchanter's Bow can be inscribed with a spell too."
				""
				"This thing does some stuff:"
				""
				"1) If you have arrows and Source, the arrow will do the spell effect (costs Source)."
				"2) If you have arrows and no Source, the arrow will just be an arrow."
				"3) If you have no arrows but you have Source, the bow will create an arrow that will just do the spell effect."
				""
				"If you want to get really fancy, you can create Augment Arrows for more spell power on hit."
			]
